WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.696
This video shows how to filter, confirm and cancel enquiries on a phone.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:19.351
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Admissions and choose Enquiries. The Admission funnel counts the enquiries at each stage: New, Confirmed, Converted and Cancelled.

00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:39.426
A line under the funnel title says to tap a stage to filter the list. Tap New, and the list shows only the New enquiries: Zara Ahmed and Hamza Ali.

00:00:43.494 --> 00:00:49.806
Type Zara in the search box. You can search by the child name or by the phone number.

00:00:53.496 --> 00:01:03.120
Zara's family has agreed, so tap Confirm on her card. The enquiry leaves the New stage, and the page says No enquiries found.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:21.692
Now search for Hamza, whose family has withdrawn. Tap Cancel on his card. A window asks you to confirm, because a cancelled enquiry cannot be reopened from this page. Tap Cancel enquiry.

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:41.832
Zara Ahmed is confirmed and Hamza Ali is cancelled, so neither is listed under New any more.
